      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. How many messages in a day (chatgpt.com) ~ 22b\n2. how many tokens they are processing ~ 352M\n3. how many gpu do they require",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r5q35_iQPEEbmcq2nCoqU",
      "originalText": "1. How many messages in a day (chatgpt.com) ~ 22b\n2. how many tokens they are processing ~ 352M\n3. how many gpu do they require",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "kwEjvYcYQ9uKUsu_169Ch",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1527.7100579565047,
      "y": 719.9041475587749,
      "width": 709.0574621551724,
      "height": 785,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
