    {
      "id": "L4njqk0eY0Pe2QvEAJj6v",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1532.7100579565047,
      "y": 737.4041475587749,
      "width": 615.9798583984375,
      "height": 750,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7I8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 453046805,
      "version": 2071,
      "versionNonce": 684158157,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792632862561,
      "created": 1792174027639,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Out of 8bn people around 75% will have internet ~ 6bn\n- 25% - kids, 10% senior, so 65% actual target ~ 4bn\n\n- out of 4bn, 50% will be aware about AI ~ 2bn\n- out of 2bn, atleast 30% would have used used gpt ~ 600M\n\n- Power users - students, white collar - 20% ~ 120M\n    - 80% active users ~ 96M \n\n- Average users - blue collar - 50% ~ 300M\n    - 40% active users ~ 48M\n\n- Casual users - 30% ~ 180M\n    - 10% active users ~ 12M\n \nTotal active users = 156M\n\n\nNow calculate the avg message per user\n\npower user - 200 messages a day\navg user - 50 messages\ncasual user - 10 messages\n\navg msg per user = total msg / total users\n\ntotal msg = 200*96 + 48*50 + 12*10 = 19200 + 2400 + 120 =\n21720/156 = 139.2 ~ 140 msg per user\n\ntherefore 140 * 156M = 22b",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "kwEjvYcYQ9uKUsu_169Ch",
      "originalText": "- Out of 8bn people around 75% will have internet ~ 6bn\n- 25% - kids, 10% senior, so 65% actual target ~ 4bn\n\n- out of 4bn, 50% will be aware about AI ~ 2bn\n- out of 2bn, atleast 30% would have used used gpt ~ 600M\n\n- Power users - students, white collar - 20% ~ 120M\n    - 80% active users ~ 96M \n\n- Average users - blue collar - 50% ~ 300M\n    - 40% active users ~ 48M\n\n- Casual users - 30% ~ 180M\n    - 10% active users ~ 12M\n \nTotal active users = 156M\n\n\nNow calculate the avg message per user\n\npower user - 200 messages a day\navg user - 50 messages\ncasual user - 10 messages\n\navg msg per user = total msg / total users\n\ntotal msg = 200*96 + 48*50 + 12*10 = 19200 + 2400 + 120 = 21720/156 = 139.2 ~ 140 msg per user\n\ntherefore 140 * 156M = 22b",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "jHwzkBwMDSB9jRonSX1UI",
