    {
      "id": "M32kpbj3PBWunsmKqlnPF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2280.169360105575,
      "y": 841.2757563885178,
      "width": 562.819580078125,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1275288597,
      "version": 1115,
      "versionNonce": 742017837,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792632862561,
      "created": 1792178505183,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "no of tokens = no of messages * avg msg token\n\navg message length = all message token / total users\n\n1 word = 1.3 tokens\n\n- power - 20 words per message - 26 tokens per message\n\n- avg - 10 words per message - 13 tokens per msg\n\n- casual - 10 words per message - 13 tokens per msg\n\neach incoming message has:\n\n1. chat history = 140 * (20+40+40) ~ 14k\n2. user message = 20\n3. system prompt ~ 2k tokens\n4. output message (40) + reasoning (40)\n\n14k + 20 + 2k + 40 + 40 = 16k tokens per message\n\nso 22k * 16k = 352M tokens",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "jHwzkBwMDSB9jRonSX1UI",
      "originalText": "no of tokens = no of messages * avg msg token\n\navg message length = all message token / total users\n\n1 word = 1.3 tokens\n\n- power - 20 words per message - 26 tokens per message\n\n- avg - 10 words per message - 13 tokens per msg\n\n- casual - 10 words per message - 13 tokens per msg\n\neach incoming message has:\n\n1. chat history = 140 * (20+40+40) ~ 14k\n2. user message = 20\n3. system prompt ~ 2k tokens\n4. output message (40) + reasoning (40)\n\n14k + 20 + 2k + 40 + 40 = 16k tokens per message\n\nso 22k * 16k = 352M tokens",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
